{"task_id": "HumanEval/59", "solution": "def largest_prime_factor(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return the largest prime factor of n.\n    Assumes n > 1 and is not a prime.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_prime_factor = 1\n\n    # Handle factor 2\n    while n % 2 == 0:\n        max_prime_factor = 2\n        n //= 2\n\n    # Handle odd factors starting from 3\n    d = 3\n    while d * d <= n:\n        while n % d == 0:\n            max_prime_factor = d\n            n //= d\n        d += 2\n\n    # If n is still greater than 1, it must be a prime factor itself\n    if n > 1:\n        max_prime_factor = n\n\n    return max_prime_factor"}
